sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client / Web Browser
    participant Gateway as Reverse Proxy / Gateway
    participant ReqId as RequestId & Log Middleware
    participant Security as Security & RateLimiter Middleware
    participant Validator as Zod Validation Middleware
    participant Controller as Inquiry Controller
    participant Service as Inquiry Service
    participant Repo as Inquiry Repository (Prisma)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant Queue as Async Job Queue
    participant Email as Email Provider (Resend)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/inquiries (JSON Payload)
    Gateway->>ReqId: Forward Request
    Note over ReqId: Generate correlation UUID<br/>Attach X-Request-Id
    ReqId->>Security: Pass to Security Pipeline
    Note over Security: Helmet headers injected<br/>CORS checked<br/>Rate limit checked (5 req/15 min)
    alt Rate Limit Exceeded
        Security-->>Client: HTTP 429 Too Many Requests { code: "RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED" }
    end

    Security->>Validator: Pass to Schema Validator
    Note over Validator: Zod strict schema check<br/>Trim, email format, max lengths
    alt Invalid Schema / Malformed JSON
        Validator-->>Client: HTTP 400 Bad Request { code: "VALIDATION_ERROR", details: [...] }
    end

    Validator->>Controller: Validated & Sanitized DTO
    Controller->>Service: createInquiry(dto)
    Service->>Repo: persistInquiry(data)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO "Inquiry" (...)
    DB-->>Repo: Saved Record (id, status, createdAt)
    Repo-->>Service: Inquiry Entity

    Note over Service,Queue: Asynchronous Decoupling:<br/>Job enqueued outside HTTP path
    Service-)Queue: Enqueue Notification Job (inquiryId, email, name)
    Service-->>Controller: Created Inquiry DTO
    Controller-->>Client: HTTP 201 Created { success: true, data: { inquiryId, status: "received" } }

    critical Background Processing
        Queue->>Email: Send Transactional Email (Resend API)
        alt Email Success
            Email-->>Queue: Message Delivered
        else Email Timeout / Failure
            Queue->>Queue: Retry with Exponential Backoff
            Note over Queue: Push to Dead-Letter Queue if max retries fail
        end
    end
